(   - Overuse of impersonal passives clutters text with empty introductory phrases:) Tj
T*
(   - Bloated: "It was observed by the investigators that the cells underwent apoptosis.") Tj
T*
(   - Streamlined Active: "The cells underwent apoptosis.") Tj
T*
