(   3. Three Remediation Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   - Strategy 1 \(Active Voice with Human Agent\):) Tj
T*
(   - "To assess microbial viability, the researchers incubated the agar plates for 24 hours.") Tj
T*
(   - Strategy 2 \(Recasting Introductory Phrase with Explicit Passive\):) Tj
T*
(   - "For microbial viability to be assessed, the agar plates were incubated for 24 hours.") Tj
T*
(   - Strategy 3 \(Nominalization of Purpose\):) Tj
T*
(   - "Assessment of microbial viability was achieved by incubating the agar plates for 24 hours.") Tj
