(   2. Modal Formulations in Control Interpretation:) Tj
T*
(   - Deduction of Contamination \(Positive Signal in Negative Control\):) Tj
T*
(   - "Because the non-template control lane produced a bright 500 bp band, the PCR master mix must) Tj
T*
(   be contaminated with exogenous plasmid template." \(High certainty; 'must be'\).) Tj
T*
(   - Deduction of Reagent Failure \(Negative Signal in Positive Control\):) Tj
T*
(   - "Because the positive control failed to fluoresce, the primary antibody must have lost its) Tj
T*
(   binding activity.") Tj
T*
(   - Deduction of Impossibility \(Cannot / Can't\):) Tj
T*
(   - "The observed 25 kDa band cannot be the full-length recombinant fusion protein, which has a) Tj
T*
(   calculated molecular weight of 72 kDa." \(Logical impossibility\).) Tj
T*
(   - Tentative Inference \(May / Might\):) Tj
T*
(   - "The faint band at 25 kDa may represent a proteolytic degradation fragment or an alternative) Tj
T*
(   splice variant.") Tj
