T*
(   1. Process Description Syntax:) Tj
T*
(   Describing industrial bioprocesses \(e.g., monoclonal antibody manufacturing, beer brewing,) Tj
T*
(   recombinant insulin production\) requires depicting an unbroken sequence of automated and) Tj
T*
(   physical transformations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Chronological Cohesion with Passive Chains:) Tj
T*
(   Deploying passive voice with transitional chronological markers \(initially, subsequently,) Tj
T*
(   thereafter, following this, finally\) establishes objective, factory-floor procedural) Tj
T*
(   continuity:) Tj
T*
(   - "Initially, the genetically engineered Chinese Hamster Ovary \(CHO\) cells are inoculated into) Tj
T*
(   seed bioreactors.") Tj
T*
(   - "Upon reaching target cell density, the culture is transferred into a 5,000-liter production) Tj
T*
