T*
(   plasmids, transgenic mice, viral vectors\) between academic institutions and pharmaceutical) Tj
T*
(   corporations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Strategic Deployment of Passive and Modal Syntax:) Tj
T*
(   - Defining Permitted Use:) Tj
T*
(   - "The Biological Material shall be used solely for non-commercial academic research purposes.") Tj
T*
(   - "The Transfected Cell Lines shall not be transferred to any third party without prior written) Tj
T*
(   consent.") Tj
T*
(   - Custody and Destruction:) Tj
T*
